  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Oh mais, c’est ce<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̀tte très ch<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̂erère <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !\nComme c’est gentil de venir te joindre à nous ! ♥<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJ’aimerais exprimer toute ma gratitude au cours\nd’un combat !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 170
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’apprécie que tu m’adresses la parole à la place\nde Dame Violine.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nEt si nous commencions le combat ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attendez ! Vous comptez vous battre à deux\ncontre un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe ou quoi ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDans ce cas, laissez-moi filer un coup de main\nà <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ! On commence le combat\ndès que tu seras prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002000210020004F006E00200063006F006D006D0065006E006300650020006C006500200063006F006D006200610074000A006400E80073002000710075006500200074007500200073006500720061007300200070007200EA007400100003110000FF0100006500200021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Battons-nous !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006100740074006F006E0073002D006E006F00750073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attends...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007400740065006E00640073002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, désolée, ça va peut-être un peu trop vite\npour toi ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLes deux filles de la FRIM attendent que tu sois\nprêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe, donc quand tu le sentiras, fais-leur signe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 170
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Montrons à ces deux FRIMeuses de quoi\nla Team MZ est capable !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F006E00740072006F006E0073002000E00020006300650073002000640065007500780020004600520049004D00650075007300650073002000640065002000710075006F0069000A006C00610020005400650061006D0020004D005A0020006500730074002000630061007000610062006C006500200021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Très ch<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̂erère, je te prie d’accepter mon invitation\nau combat !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007200E8007300200063006800100003110000FF03020065007200E800720065002C0020006A006500200074006500200070007200690065002000642019006100630063006500700074006500720020006D006F006E00200069006E007600690074006100740069006F006E000A0061007500200063006F006D0062006100740020002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu acceptes de te battre contre nous,\nn’est-ce pas ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540075002000610063006300650070007400650073002000640065002000740065002000620061007400740072006500200063006F006E0074007200650020006E006F00750073002C000A006E2019006500730074002D0063006500200070006100730020003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Battons-nous !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006100740074006F006E0073002D006E006F00750073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attendez encore un petit peu...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007400740065006E00640065007A00200065006E0063006F0072006500200075006E0020007000650074006900740020007000650075002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pitié, cesse de me décevoir ! J’exige une réponse\npositive de ta part !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ma fidèle Delphie est à mes côtés,\nnotre victoire est assurée ! ♥<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061002000660069006400E8006C0065002000440065006C00700068006900650020006500730074002000E00020006D006500730020006300F4007400E90073002C000A006E006F00740072006500200076006900630074006F006900720065002000650073007400200061007300730075007200E90065002000210020266500100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ton destin est de nous affronter.\nTu ne pourras pas te défiler éternellement.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En garde ! Je vais montrer à Dame Violine\nà quel point je peux me rendre utile !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand tu seras prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe, va le dire à une des deux\nFRIMeuses !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750061006E006400200074007500200073006500720061007300200070007200EA007400100003110000FF01000065002C0020007600610020006C006500200064006900720065002000E000200075006E0065002000640065007300200064006500750078000A004600520049004D0065007500730065007300200021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Notre rôle en tant qu’élite de la société est de\nmontrer l’exemple ! Mélodelfe, à toi de jouer ! ♥<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai gardé l’meilleur pour la fin !\nKravarech, méga-évolue et déchaîne-toi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, Staross ! On va leur montrer à quel point\non a bossé notre footwork !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On a réussi ! On a gagné !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E002000610020007200E90075007300730069002000210020004F006E002000610020006700610067006E00E900200021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ton habileté ne m’étonne guère, m<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ܇on chera chère\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, mais j’avoue avoir été surprise<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npar le sens du rythme du Staross de Rudi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous savez, Dame Violine...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0075007300200073006100760065007A002C002000440061006D0065002000560069006F006C0069006E0065002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les personnes douées en danse sont dotées d’un\ncorps robuste et d’une grande maîtrise de soi,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndeux qualités essentielles en arts martiaux.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIl va de soi qu’une Dresseuse telle que Rudi peut\ntout à fait transmettre ces talents à ses Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 250
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Puis-je vous suggérer de suivre des cours\nde danse ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050007500690073002D006A006500200076006F007500730020007300750067006700E90072006500720020006400650020007300750069007600720065002000640065007300200063006F007500720073000A00640065002000640061006E007300650020003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ma chère... Vous semblez oublier que je n’ai\naucun sens du rythme.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006100200063006800E800720065002E002E002E00200056006F00750073002000730065006D0062006C0065007A0020006F00750062006C00690065007200200071007500650020006A00650020006E201900610069000A0061007500630075006E002000730065006E007300200064007500200072007900740068006D0065002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tu veux, je peux t’apprendre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006900200074007500200076006500750078002C0020006A00650020007000650075007800200074201900610070007000720065006E00640072006500200021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh... Je suis touchée. C’est bien aimable de\nta part.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002E002E002E0020004A00650020007300750069007300200074006F00750063006800E90065002E0020004320190065007300740020006200690065006E002000610069006D00610062006C0065002000640065000A0074006100200070006100720074002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "M<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĂona ch<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̂erère <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>. Accepte ce modeste\nprésent en guise de symbole de ta victoire.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous obtenez la robe de Violine !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006F006200740065006E0065007A0020006C006100200072006F00620065002000640065002000560069006F006C0069006E0065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu vas pouvoir t’habiller comme Violine ?\nÇa alors, tout est possible à Extra Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si la Violine de l’extradimension trouve qu’elle a\npas le sens du rythme, peut-être que c’est pareil<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npour celle du monde réel ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand je pense que j’ai fui les danses de salon\ncomme la peste...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750061006E00640020006A0065002000700065006E0073006500200071007500650020006A20190061006900200066007500690020006C00650073002000640061006E007300650073002000640065002000730061006C006F006E000A0063006F006D006D00650020006C0061002000700065007300740065002E002E002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il se trouve que la danse fait partie de mes loisirs.\nPeut-être pourrais-je l’enseigner à Dame Violine ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    }
  ],
